<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Ciadea gets $50 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Ciadea gets $50 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine carmaker Ciadea SA said Wednesday it has received a $50 million three-year syndicated loan.</p>
<p>ABN Amro Bank and Deutsche Bank Argentina SA organized the loan, said Ciadea in a statement.</p>
<p>Interest on the loan is LIBOR plus 325 basis points.</p>
<p>((-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
